tpm 1
boot power
end 26000
# attract-cycle: power-on with no input, one full attract cycle (docs/re/title.md §4): SW_ON,
# TIT_DEMO, TITLE; the title times out into HOW_N (Classic demo), then HOW_P (Puzzle demo),
# RANKING, TIT_DEMO, TITLE again, whose timeout now runs HOW_VS (VS demo), then RANKING and
# TIT_DEMO.
